{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"queriesobserver","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"QueriesObserver"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"QueriesObserver"},{"type":"text","value":" can be used to observe multiple queries."}]},{"type":"code","value":"const observer = new QueriesObserver(queryClient, [\n  { queryKey: ['post', 1], queryFn: fetchPost },\n  { queryKey: ['post', 2], queryFn: fetchPost },\n])\n\nconst unsubscribe = observer.subscribe(result => {\n  console.log(result)\n  unsubscribe()\n})","lang":"js"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Options"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The options for the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"QueriesObserver"},{"type":"text","value":" are exactly the same as those of "},{"type":"link","href":"/reference/useQueries","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useQueries"}]},{"type":"text","value":"."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"queriesobserver","text":"QueriesObserver","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n## `QueriesObserver`\n\nThe `QueriesObserver` can be used to observe multiple queries.\n\n```js\nconst observer = new QueriesObserver(queryClient, [\n  { queryKey: ['post', 1], queryFn: fetchPost },\n  { queryKey: ['post', 2], queryFn: fetchPost },\n])\n\nconst unsubscribe = observer.subscribe(result => {\n  console.log(result)\n  unsubscribe()\n})\n```\n\n**Options**\n\nThe options for the `QueriesObserver` are exactly the same as those of [`useQueries`](/reference/useQueries).\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: QueriesObserver\ntitle: QueriesObserver\n---\n\n## `QueriesObserver`\n\nThe `QueriesObserver` can be used to observe multiple queries.\n\n```js\nconst observer = new QueriesObserver(queryClient, [\n  { queryKey: ['post', 1], queryFn: fetchPost },\n  { queryKey: ['post', 2], queryFn: fetchPost },\n])\n\nconst unsubscribe = observer.subscribe(result => {\n  console.log(result)\n  unsubscribe()\n})\n```\n\n**Options**\n\nThe options for the `QueriesObserver` are exactly the same as those of [`useQueries`](/reference/useQueries).\n"}
